                      (      basic09.asm):00016         * Mem directive fixed to take more than 32k
                      (      basic09.asm):00017         *
                      (      basic09.asm):00018         *  19      1982/11/02  Robert F. Doggett (Microware)
                      (      basic09.asm):00019         * Default USING field size 1 if unspecified
                      (      basic09.asm):00020         * Prevent death on out of range input
                      (      basic09.asm):00021         *
                      (      basic09.asm):00022         *  19      1982/11/16  Robert F. Doggett (Microware)
                      (      basic09.asm):00023         * Compiler var "CNTASS" initialized to fix random crash if T.CXAS inserted by mistake
                      (      basic09.asm):00024         * Mem comand made to request 1 less byte
                      (      basic09.asm):00025         *
                      (      basic09.asm):00026         *  20      1983/01/12  Robert F. Doggett (Microware)
                      (      basic09.asm):00027         * Changed string terminator from $FF to $00, allowing 8-bit data in string functions
                      (      basic09.asm):00028         *
                      (      basic09.asm):00029         *  20      1983/01/17  Microware
                      (      basic09.asm):00030         * General clean up
                      (      basic09.asm):00031         *
                      (      basic09.asm):00032         *  20      1983/01/19  Robert F. Doggett (Microware)
                      (      basic09.asm):00033         * Changed string terminator from $00 to $FF to maintain I-Code compatability
                      (      basic09.asm):00034         *
                      (      basic09.asm):00035         *  20      1983/01/21  Robert F. Doggett (Microware)
                      (      basic09.asm):00036         * Fixed problem in USING with Real Zero
                      (      basic09.asm):00037         *
                      (      basic09.asm):00038         *  20      1983/01/24  Robert F. Doggett (Microware)
                      (      basic09.asm):00039         * Struct assignment of exactly 256 crashed
                      (      basic09.asm):00040         * Rename any Proc to number crashed system
                      (      basic09.asm):00041         *
                      (      basic09.asm):00042         *  20      1983/01/25  Robert F. Doggett (Microware)
                      (      basic09.asm):00043         * Startup now clears all DP Globals
                      (      basic09.asm):00044         * IOBuff could overflow into system stack
                      (      basic09.asm):00045         *
                      (      basic09.asm):00046         *  20      1983/02/07  Larry Crane (Microware)
                      (      basic09.asm):00047         * Kept Opstack from going crazy, killing system when exponentiation overflow occurred
                      (      basic09.asm):00048         *
