                      (      basic09.asm):00050         * Added conditional asm for Tandy ^N
                      (      basic09.asm):00051         * Prevented DEBUG mode from recursive entry
                      (      basic09.asm):00052         *
                      (      basic09.asm):00053         *  20      1983/02/15  Robert F. Doggett (Microware)
                      (      basic09.asm):00054         * Made aborted RunB return error to Shell
                      (      basic09.asm):00055         *
                      (      basic09.asm):00056         *  20      1983/02/17  Robert F. Doggett (Microware)
                      (      basic09.asm):00057         * Added Microware to copyright notice
                      (      basic09.asm):00058         * CTL-Q was ignored in asm subroutines
                      (      basic09.asm):00059         * RunB ON ERROR now intercepts CTL-C, CTL-Q
                      (      basic09.asm):00060         *
                      (      basic09.asm):00061         *  21      1983/03/16  Robert F. Doggett (Microware)
                      (      basic09.asm):00062         * Fixed bug in TRON caused in edition 20
