                      (      basic09.asm):00075         *
                      (      basic09.asm):00076         *  V1.21   1994/06/17  NitrOS-9 Project
                      (      basic09.asm):00077         * Changed intercept routine @ INTCPT: Replaced LSL <u0034/COMA/
                      (      basic09.asm):00078         *            ROR <u0034/RTI with OIM #$80,<u0034/RTI/NOP/NOP
                      (      basic09.asm):00079         * Changed routine @ start:
                      (      basic09.asm):00080         *               FROM                TO
                      (      basic09.asm):00081         *          4   LEAU >$100,u    4   LDW #$100
                      (      basic09.asm):00082         *          1   CLRA            2   CLR ,-s
                      (      basic09.asm):00083         *          1   CLRB            3   TFM s,u+
                      (      basic09.asm):00084         *          2   STD  ,--u       2   LEAS 1,s
                      (      basic09.asm):00085         *          3   CMPU ,s         1   NOP
                      (      basic09.asm):00086         *          2   BHI  START0      1   NOP
                      (      basic09.asm):00087         * Bytes:  15                  15
                      (      basic09.asm):00088         * Changed CLRA/LDB #$01 to LDD #$0001 @ end of start
                      (      basic09.asm):00089         *
                      (      basic09.asm):00090         *  V1.21   1994/06/22  NitrOS-9 Project
                      (      basic09.asm):00091         * Changed L0DBB (reset temp buffer to empty state) to use PSHS D
                      (      basic09.asm):00092         * LDA #1 / STA <u007D / LDD <u0080 / STD <u0082 / PULS PC,D
                      (      basic09.asm):00093         *            (saves 5 cycles) ALSO WORKS AS 6809 MOD
                      (      basic09.asm):00094         * Changed BEQ L08E3 to BEQ L08E5 @ RUNCMD (Std in for commands)
                      (      basic09.asm):00095         * Changed numerous CLRA/CLRB and COMA/COMB to CLRD & COMD respectiv
                      (      basic09.asm):00096         *            just to shorten source
                      (      basic09.asm):00097         *
                      (      basic09.asm):00098         *  V1.21   1994/06/27  NitrOS-9 Project
                      (      basic09.asm):00099         * Added 2nd TFM to init routine to clear out $400-$4ff
                      (      basic09.asm):00100         *
                      (      basic09.asm):00101         *  V1.21   1994/06/28  NitrOS-9 Project
                      (      basic09.asm):00102         * Changed BRA OUTCHR99 @ OUTCHR to PULS PC,U,A (6809 TOO)
                      (      basic09.asm):00103         *
                      (      basic09.asm):00104         *  V1.21   1994/12/22  NitrOS-9 Project
                      (      basic09.asm):00105         * BIG TEST: TOOK OUT NOP'D CODE - SEE IF IT STILL WORKS
                      (      basic09.asm):00106         * IT DOESN'T - MOVED ALL NOPS TO JUST BEFORE ICPT ROUTINE TO
